> u1(x: u8 uniform in 0..15, y: u8 in 0..15) = x*y + y
> u2(x: u8 uniform in 0..15, y: u8 in 0..15) = y*(x+1)
> equiv u1 ~ u2
u1 and u2 are equal on the domain of u1 (exhaustive)
> domain u1
domain of u1:
  x: u8, 0..15
  y: u8, 0..15
  defined at 256 of 256 points
  no conditions: total on its parameter types
  over all 256 points of the domain
> range u1
range of u1 -> u8:
  0..240   (97 distinct values)
  fits in u8
  over all 256 points of the domain
